    :addproperty               String
    :defaultvalue              String
    :message                   String
    :validargs                 String
  Nested elements:
    :handler                   (Handler)
  Body text: this element accepts a free-form text body.

  https://ant.apache.org/manual/Tasks/input.html

  Defined by: org.apache.tools.ant.taskdefs.Input"
