    :relative                  boolean
    :resource                  String
    :runtime                   String
    :url                       URL
    :userproperty              boolean
    :value                     Object
  Nested elements:
    :classpath                 (Path)
  Body text: this element accepts a free-form text body.

  https://ant.apache.org/manual/Tasks/property.html

  Defined by: org.apache.tools.ant.taskdefs.Property"
