  end up in the WEB-INF/lib , WEB-INF/classes or WEB-INF directories of the
  Web Application Archive. (The War task is a shortcut for specifying the
  particular layout of a WAR file. The same thing can be accomplished by using
  the prefix and fullpath attributes of zipfileset s in a Zip or Jar task.)
